# {{titleCase name}}

This module lives entirely under `src/modules/{{kebabCase name}}/`. Everything it
contributes to the app is declared in `{{kebabCase name}}.module.tsx`:

- Routes — auto-mounted at `/{{kebabCase name}}/*`
- Sidebar menu entries
- Translations (uz / ru / en)
- Permission keys + descriptions

## Suggested layout

```
{{kebabCase name}}/
├── {{kebabCase name}}.module.tsx   ← manifest (single source of truth)
├── pages/                          ← route page components
├── components/                     ← module-specific UI (when shared/ui doesn't fit)
├── api/                            ← TanStack Query hooks + data source
├── model/                          ← types, zustand stores
├── lib/                            ← helpers
└── widgets/                        ← composite widgets
```

Add as many folders/files inside as you need — the *outside* of this folder is
off-limits, the inside is yours.

## Reminders

- Don't import from another module (`@/modules/<other>`) — eslint will block.
- Don't edit `shared/`, `app/`, `package.json` without the lead's approval.
- Use generators (`pnpm gen:module`) for new modules.
